    "as-s-howto": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "page": "v4",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Assist layer · 10 Oct 2026\n\nThree surfaces, no chat window.\n\nA · In place: Assist puts a proposal next to the field it would fill, with the source beside it.\n\nB · Command bar: opens on Ctrl K, takes one request, shows a plan before it acts, then closes.\n\nC · Tray: a small button in the header. What needs your OK, what it is working on, what it did.\n\nRule: it never changes a price or confirms anything without your OK. Filled values are marked and can be undone.",
      "w": 460,
      "x": 4560,
      "y": 6600
    },
    "as-t-1": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 4480,
